With [+ gnu_candidate +]'s victory, the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>'s can finally consolidate power with the Chancellorship and Presidency in their hands. [? if heartland_leader == "Bristol": His first action is to depose Lyle Bristol from Heartland, and to install Chancellor [+ chancellor +] as a <i>Reichskommissar</i>. ?]

- @game_over: Game over.

